// The writes of the whole program, found once: for every function, which
// exported variables its statements write (wr_node says what a write is), as
// two parallel columns -- wrx a key, "i:NAME" for a write through (import NAME)
// and "v:NAME" for one through the bare name the declaring function uses, and
// wrf the function that does it. A case may not read back a variable that the
// function under test only declares (chk_own_import, ../more/flag/reqtests.id),
// and "only declares" is decided from this table. Built from `prog` as it
// stands when the first case asks, as reach's memo is (given/read/reach/memo.id).
wr_ready() {
  if((import wrdone)[0] == 0) {
    wr_build();
  }
} return void;
